<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1436908747"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1804675341"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="color capsule"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="やなぎなぎ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="memorandum"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:23.344"><div begin="00:25.731" end="03:23.844"><p begin="00:25.731" end="00:38.587" itunes:key="L10812">数えきれない色の詰まった箱に砂をかけて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向装满了无数色彩的箱中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka zo e ki re na i i ro no tsu ma 't ta ha ko ni</span></p><p begin="00:38.389" end="00:47.692" itunes:key="L10813">また会えるまで綺麗でいてね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再会之前 请保持美丽</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta a e ru ma de ki re i de i te ne</span></p><p begin="00:47.685" end="00:51.267" itunes:key="L10814">冗談めかして笑う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假装开玩笑的样子笑起来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">jo u da n me ka shi te wa ra u</span></p><p begin="00:51.068" end="00:57.160" itunes:key="L10815">ひとつずつ褪せてゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">記憶的调色盘一点一点</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to tsu zu tsu a se te yu ku</span></p><p begin="00:56.941" end="01:00.630" itunes:key="L10816">記憶のパレット<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逐渐淡去色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki o ku no pa re 't to</span></p><p begin="01:00.365" end="01:03.889" itunes:key="L10817">人は忘れる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人总是健忘的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to wa wa su re ru</span></p><p begin="01:03.515" end="01:11.320" itunes:key="L10818">味気ない世界で見上げた空は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在无趣的世界中仰望的天空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ji ke na i se ka i de mi a ge ta so ra wa</span></p><p begin="01:11.169" end="01:16.208" itunes:key="L10819">やけに遠く感じて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉无比遥远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ke ni to o ku ka n ji te</span></p><p begin="01:16.097" end="01:20.929" itunes:key="L10820">光も雨も降らない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有光芒也没有落雨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ka ri mo a me mo fu ra na i</span></p><p begin="01:20.659" end="01:29.044" itunes:key="L10821">一生分の孤独のよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛绵延一生的孤独</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 's sho u bu n no ko do ku no yo u</span></p><p begin="01:45.495" end="01:57.763" itunes:key="L10822">いちばん高い木に背を向けて３歩<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">背对最高的树走3步</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i chi ba n ta ka i ki ni se wo mu ke te sa n po</span></p><p begin="01:58.164" end="02:10.383" itunes:key="L10823">今なら１歩で届いてしまうかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在是否只需1步就能抵达</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma na ra i 'p po de to do i te shi ma u ka na</span></p><p begin="02:32.128" end="02:35.364" itunes:key="L10824">ふいに薫った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不经意间嗅到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu i ni ka o 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:35.050" end="02:40.678" itunes:key="L10825">懐かしい世界の香り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀恋的世界的清香</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na tsu ka shi i se ka i no ka o ri tsu na i de ku</span></p><p begin="02:40.378" end="02:47.704" itunes:key="L10826">繋いでく途切れた色の続き<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将一切紧密相连 拾起曾经想要舍弃的色彩</span></p><p begin="02:47.695" end="02:52.501" itunes:key="L10827">虹のあふれる箱はまだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虹彩斑斓的箱子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni ji no a fu re ru ha ko wa ma da</span></p><p begin="02:52.222" end="02:57.409" itunes:key="L10828">少しあたたかいまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍有着一丝温暖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ko shi a ta ta ka i ma ma</span></p><p begin="02:57.207" end="03:01.956" itunes:key="L10829">色づく世界揺れて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那愈渐多彩的世界 若隐若现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ro zu ku se ka i yu re te</span></p><p begin="03:01.687" end="03:10.061" itunes:key="L10830">頬を伝ってく触れるすべてを染めて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">滴落到我的脸颊上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ho wo tsu ta 't te ku</span></p><p begin="03:09.805" end="03:15.590" itunes:key="L10831">今一際鮮やかに光る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻 格外明艳的光芒照耀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma hi to ki wa a za ya ka ni hi ka ru</span></p><p begin="03:14.994" end="03:23.844" itunes:key="L10832">君の姿見つけた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我找到了你的身影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no su ga ta mi tsu ke ta</span></p></div></body></tt>